{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00670",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.98,
      "end_seconds": 18.5,
      "duration_seconds": 17.52,
      "text": "Hi, hello, sorry, I'm Bruce, I'm here for the cataract thing, the pre-op, my wife said I should bring my tablet list but I've left it in the ute, so I'll just tell you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 20.59,
      "end_seconds": 33.55,
      "duration_seconds": 12.96,
      "text": "That's all right, Bruce, I'm Linda, the pre-op nurse. We've got your list on the system, and we'll check it against what you tell us. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.15,
      "end_seconds": 46.21,
      "duration_seconds": 10.06,
      "text": "I'm Dr Wallace. We've got you down for the left eye. Let's look at your medicines first. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.81,
      "end_seconds": 61.57,
      "duration_seconds": 13.76,
      "text": "The blood thinner, warfarin, I think it's 3 mg. And the sugar one, metformin, maybe 500 mg, twice a day, or is it once?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 63.2,
      "end_seconds": 67.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Our list says warfarin 5 mg, Bruce."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.97,
      "end_seconds": 76.97,
      "duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "text": "No, mate, it's 3. It's definitely 3. Well, it might have gone up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 79.1,
      "end_seconds": 89.01,
      "duration_seconds": 9.91,
      "text": "I'll write down 3 from you and 5 from our records, and we'll check with the pharmacy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.09,
      "end_seconds": 100.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.93,
      "text": "Good. For metformin, we'll check that as well. Any allergies to anything, medicines, latex, eye drops?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.57,
      "end_seconds": 105.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Nope. No allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.04,
      "end_seconds": 115.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.52,
      "text": "Any cough or cold lately, anything that would stop you lying flat for the operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.76,
      "end_seconds": 121.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "No, nothing like that. No cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.59,
      "end_seconds": 127.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.09,
      "end_seconds": 133.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Couple of tinnies on Saturday. Not more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.16,
      "end_seconds": 162.51,
      "duration_seconds": 8.35,
      "text": "That's fine. Now the eye. I'll have a look at the lens. Chin on the rest, Bruce."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.64,
      "end_seconds": 169.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "This the one with the light? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.81,
      "end_seconds": 174.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "That's it. Look straight ahead. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.1,
      "end_seconds": 187.83,
      "duration_seconds": 11.73,
      "text": "Yes, the lens in the left eye is clouded, which fits with a cataract, and it's why your vision has been misty."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.51,
      "end_seconds": 196.68,
      "duration_seconds": 6.17,
      "text": "How much longer before I can drive at night again? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.79,
      "end_seconds": 212.96,
      "duration_seconds": 13.17,
      "text": "After the operation, it's usually a few weeks. The surgery's about twenty minutes, under local anaesthetic, you go home the same day. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.72,
      "end_seconds": 221.86,
      "duration_seconds": 6.14,
      "text": "My wife says I'll be a lot more pleasant. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.98,
      "end_seconds": 235.6,
      "duration_seconds": 11.62,
      "text": "Bruce, since you're on warfarin, I'd like to arrange a blood test before surgery, to check how thin your blood is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.03,
      "end_seconds": 241.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Is that the INR? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 243.84,
      "end_seconds": 249.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.44,
      "text": "That's it. We'll book it two days before the operation. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.65,
      "end_seconds": 261.55,
      "duration_seconds": 8.9,
      "text": "And if the INR is too high, we'll ring you, and we may have to move the date."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.34,
      "end_seconds": 269.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "Fair enough. Should I stop the warfarin? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.53,
      "end_seconds": 278.64,
      "duration_seconds": 7.11,
      "text": "Don't stop anything yet, unless we tell you. We'll give you clear written instructions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 281.33,
      "end_seconds": 286.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "I'll print them for you now, Bruce. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.48,
      "end_seconds": 293.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Beauty. And where do I park? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 295.61,
      "end_seconds": 299.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Round the back, there's free spaces. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.75,
      "end_seconds": 306.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "You've been brilliant. Thanks, both. ~"
    }
  ]
}
